{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"b0ae8862052822435fd68c5c61537333b19ea47f506afc84665d6d4c18618872","digest":{"component_or_area":"plan-review sidecar and decision kernel","key_entities":["src/rebar/llm/plan_review/sidecar.py","src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/decide.py","SCHEMA (plan_review_result_v1 -> v2)","REVIEW_RESULT event","_slim step","ThresholdResolver","latest_review_result","pass3_decide","pass3_over_findings","block_threshold","blocking_enabled","evidence[]","scenarios[]"],"problem_keywords":["plan-review sidecar","schema versioning","evidence persistence","audit trail","threshold resolution","decision boundary"],"propositions":["The current plan-review REVIEW_RESULT sidecar drops pass-1 evidence and scenarios fields in the _slim step, making findings non-auditable.","Resolved block_threshold and blocking_enabled values are computed during pass-3 decision but not persisted, preventing auditors from verifying the exact decision boundary applied to each finding.","Extend plan_review_result to schema v2 to durably record per-finding evidence, scenarios, block_threshold, and blocking_enabled alongside existing fields.","The ThresholdResolver result in pass-3 must be exposed and threaded into persisted finding decisions so the applied threshold is captured at the point of application.","Both v1 and v2 sidecar formats must be readable; v1 records treat new fields as absent, and no backfill is required for existing events."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785819774385137982,"uuid":"9c3452f2-c049-4002-9409-e0841559e49c"}